{"AIMED_AT","role=elite_operator",{"You're aimed in. Are you sure you want to do this?"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=elite|tmp=veteran",{"I don't flinch and I don't bluff - lower it"}},
{"AIMED_AT","role=elite_operator,elite_delta",{"That's a bad angle and a worse plan"}},
{"AIMED_AT","role=mercenary",{"I've still got rounds left, lower it"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=outlaw|tmp=seasoned",{"You gonna use that or hold it? Because I get bored","A better man pointed that same gun at me, he's in a ditch off 31W"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=outlaw,crime",{"Careful, you shoot me and my people find out from the noise"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=outlaw,club|tmp=seasoned",{"You've got about as much steel in your eyes as a wet paper sack"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang",{"Go on - squeeze it, then count how many of us are left"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=raider|tmp=predator",{"You'd better mean it if you're pointing that at me","You aim at me? At ME? Boys! Boys, come look at this!","You know what I do to folks who aim and don't shoot? Guess"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=raider,gang|tmp=predator",{"That's cute, my friends behind you ain't cute"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=raider,prison|tmp=predator",{"Do it - DO IT! I want to see what you're made of!","I hope it jams, I hope it jams and I get to watch your face"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=raider,club,gang",{"Think about what you're doing before you make it worse"}},
{"AIMED_AT","role=raider_boss",{"Nobody points at me, kill him if he so much as sneezes"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=gang",{"You pull on me? Out here? With no crew behind you?","Put it down, {g:man|lady}, this ain't the play - this ain't never the play"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=gang,crime",{"That's a whole lot of gun for a man standing by himself"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=gang,prison",{"You aim it, you better use it - you know that, right? You know that"}},
{"AIMED_AT","role=gang_boss|world=building",{"You trying to impress somebody? Lower it"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=club",{"You're aiming at a patch, friend, that's a county-wide problem now","Point that at me and every man on a bike hears your description"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=club|tmp=predator",{"Easy. You're getting into more trouble than you need"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=club,crime",{"That's a pretty piece, shame whose hands it's in"}},
{"AIMED_AT","role=biker_boss",{"Lower it and you ride out, keep it up and you don't ride again"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=crime",{"Put that down, I'm the man who makes things go away, and I'm being nice","You aimed - fine, now it's a negotiation with a gun in it"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=crime|tmp=veteran",{"Everybody who's pointed one at me is still paying for it","I don't get shot, I get told about people who tried"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=crime|tmp=seasoned",{"That's a very loud way to solve a quiet problem"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=crime,outlaw,elite|tmp=veteran",{"You're holding it like a man who's never been shot at"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=prison|tmp=predator",{"HA! Point it! Point it right here! Right HERE!","Shoot me - go on, I've been dead since '89, they just kept feeding me","You want a fight? Is that it?"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=prison",{"You think a gun scares me? I slept next to men with nothing to lose"}},
{"AIMED_AT","role=prisoner",{"First gun I've seen in eight years, and it's pointed the wrong way"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=prison,raider",{"Point it or put it away, I ain't standing here for your nerves"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=civilian,worker,outlaw,law|hour=21,4",{"You're pointing that at a man in the dark, nobody wins that one"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=hostile",{"Shoot then! SHOOT! I'm done being scared of people!"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=law,military,swat,elite|tmp=veteran",{"You're four feet away, neither of us likes what four feet does"}},
