{"AIMED_AT","",{"Hey! What's that for?","Finger off the trigger. People sneeze","Wait-- what are you doing?","Four feet. Give me four feet and we'll talk","Hold on. Count to five, then decide","You haven't said a word. That worries me more than the barrel","That safety on? Humor me and check","Easy now. I'm somebody's neighbor, same as you","Don't point that at me. I'm listening","Look, we can talk without this","Easy. You don't have to do that","I've got enough to be afraid of","Please, put it down a little","What do you need? Just say it","I can't think with that pointed at me","You're making this worse for both of us","Careful. A mistake here can't be taken back","Quit waving that at me","I'm here. I heard you. Lower it","Let's not find out how this ends","You can ask me without doing that","I'm trying to stay calm. Help me out"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Half a can of peaches and a church key, that's all I carry. Take 'em","I still owe Mrs. Hatcher her casserole dish, so I can't die yet","What'd I do? I haven't even been to Rosewood since Sunday","I've got a flashlight and a church bulletin. That's the whole arsenal","Oh, come on... I coached Little League in Brandenburg","My knees are shaking so hard you can probably hear them","Tell me what you want. I know where everything in this town is kept","One second. I'm showing you both hands, slow","My boy's twelve. If he sees this, he never sleeps right again","My heart's going like a hammer. Give me a second to say something","My hands are empty - see? Point it somewhere else","That thing is loaded - be careful where you aim it"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=law,swat,military,elite",{"Lower it. Everything after this is on your side of the ledger","Your thumb's on the wrong side of that. Fix it before it matters","You miss and I don't. Do the arithmetic before you pull","Ask for it. People used to just ask","Weapon down. I'll hear all of it, but not over that","Is this a warning, or are you out of ideas?","Slow. Fast is how my last partner got buried","What's the plan once you pull it? Say it out loud","One step back. I've got people behind me who can't see your hands","Sling it, holster it, I don't care. Just not at me","Think about the next ten seconds. I already have","I've written that report before. Nobody likes how it ends","I'm going to speak now. Don't mistake it for moving","You're ten pounds of trigger pull from a very bad day","Steady. I know that look. I've worn it"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Easy. I owe three men money and none of them are you","Words are free. That thing's gonna cost you a bullet","That thing even loaded? Don't lie to me","You gonna let me talk, or you just enjoy the click?","Put that aside. I got one question, where'd you get those boots?","Don't start that. Last fella who did is under the Marathon sign","Aw, hell... you shake like that, you'll shoot your own foot","You really want to do this? Point it at me again","Hey! Easy! Watch where you point that thing!","You got a death wish, {g:pal|lady}?","Go ahead, pull the trigger, see what happens","Lower it or I'll stuff it somewhere uncomfortable"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Please don't point that at me! I'm not a threat!","Oh God, oh God, it's pointed right at me!","Please- no- I don't even have a knife, see?!","Put it down! Please put it down!"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"You want to lower that before somebody gets hurt?","I'm not looking for a fight - lower it"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"Lower your weapon! You're pointing it at an officer!","Drop it, drop the weapon - last warning","You do not want to do this - lower it, now","Aiming at a deputy is a bad idea, friend - put it down"}},
{"AIMED_AT","reg=swat|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"Weapon on me - lower it or we go","Last chance - lower the weapon"}},
